{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":16.16},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":17.68,"end":32.72},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":34.52,"end":48.4}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":4,"text":"粒子模型說明過濾器為何留住較大的不溶物，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":4.32,"end":6.72,"text":"而溶劑和溶質能通過。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":7.68,"end":10.16,"text":"圖上粒子是象徵大小，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":10.24,"end":11.36,"text":"不是分子比例。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":12.16,"end":14.08,"text":"重點是選擇性通過，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":14.32,"end":16.16,"text":"不是圖案實際尺寸。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":17.68,"end":18.56,"text":"啟用過濾，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":18.72,"end":21.04,"text":"比較留下的物質和濾液。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":21.92,"end":23.52,"text":"追蹤溶質符號，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":23.76,"end":27.04,"text":"不要假設濾器會移除所有東西。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":28.2,"end":29.2,"text":"在這個模型中，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":29.6,"end":32.72,"text":"通常什麼會跟水一起通過濾器？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":34.52,"end":35.52,"text":"在這個模型中，"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":35.92,"end":39.28,"text":"通常什麼會跟水一起通過濾器？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":40.88,"end":44.96,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":45.6,"end":48.4,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}